DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
11671::$$$message_0093_0000_0000$$$::"Fuji-nee?"[lr]::
11672::$$$message_0093_0000_0001$$$::When I go to the port for the first time in a while, there's an unexpected visitor waiting for me.::
11673::$$$message_0093_0001_0000$$$::"Oh, Shirou...what are you doing here?"[lr]::
11674::$$$message_0093_0001_0001$$$::"I could ask you the same thing. Did you have some business at the port?"[lr]::
11675::$$$message_0093_0001_0002$$$::It throws me off.[lr]::
11676::$$$message_0093_0001_0003$$$::Since we see each other from morning to night, it's different when we meet at a place like this.::
11677::$$$message_0093_0002_0000$$$::"Mrgh, you can't ditch school and walk around a place like this."[lr]::
11678::$$$message_0093_0002_0001$$$::"But you're also..."[lr]::
11679::$$$message_0093_0002_0002$$$::"Yeah, well I guess I'll cut you some slack for today since it's before a break."::
11680::$$$message_0093_0003_0000$$$::I thought she would pull my ear and take me back to school, but she must be in a good mood as I dodged a bullet.[lr]::
11681::$$$message_0093_0003_0001$$$::...Well, even if Fuji-nee is in a good mood, she doesn't approve of ditching. More than in a good mood, she must be feeling down.::
11682::$$$message_0093_0004_0000$$$::"...You don't seem like yourself today."[lr]::
11683::$$$message_0093_0004_0001$$$::"Really?"[lr]::
11684::$$$message_0093_0004_0002$$$::"Well, you would usually be like..."[lr]::
11685::$$$message_0093_0004_0003$$$::I put my leg on the protruding part of the pier and strike a pose.[lr]::
11686::$$$message_0093_0004_0004$$$::Like a seaman, a character from the "Wanderer" series, or a captain pretending to have a pipe in his mouth.::
11687::$$$message_0093_0005_0000$$$::"'I am a seawoman, you'll burn yourself if you fall in love with a wanderer like me...' saying something like that."[lr]::
11688::$$$message_0093_0005_0001$$$::"Ahaha, that might fit me and would be fun."::
11689::$$$message_0093_0006_0000$$$::"...I don't know, I feel like it's weird even more than now."[lr]::
11690::$$$message_0093_0006_0001$$$::I imagine it for a moment, but it would be weird for a sea captain to be at this port after all.[lr]::
11691::$$$message_0093_0006_0002$$$::But, it's oddly natural if it's Fuji-nee.::
11692::$$$message_0093_0007_0000$$$::"Wait, can you even get a sailor suit with a striped shirt and pantaloons nowadays?"[lr]::
11693::$$$message_0093_0007_0001$$$::"Mrgh, my sailor school uniform is quite something, too."[lr]::
11694::$$$message_0093_0007_0002$$$::"Back then it was... Oh, but please don't bring your sailor uniform."::
11695::$$$message_0093_0008_0000$$$::A sailor uniform on someone over twenty is tough to look at.[lr]::
11696::$$$message_0093_0008_0001$$$::We're at the port, so Fuji-nee might look good in an actual sailor suit.::
11697::$$$message_0093_0009_0000$$$::"The sea, huh... Come to think of it, when I was still wearing something like that, I chased after Kiritsugu."[lr]::
11698::$$$message_0093_0009_0001$$$::Fuji-nee murmurs nostalgically, looking into the horizon of the port.::
11699::$$$message_0093_0010_0000$$$::I don't know what Kiritsugu was thinking, but he would often go overseas by riding a cargo ship from this port.[lr]::
11700::$$$message_0093_0010_0001$$$::Even if I told him to go by plane, he would tell me, "No, Shirou. Hiding yourself among the cargo is also the spirit of adventure..."::
11701::$$$message_0093_0011_0000$$$::"Well, I think it's better that you didn't chase after him."[lr]::
11702::$$$message_0093_0011_0001$$$::"Yeah. I'll be sent back if I go out of the country without my passport."[lr]::
11703::$$$message_0093_0011_0002$$$::"..."::
11704::$$$message_0093_0012_0000$$$::So she would've chased after him if she had her passport.[lr]::
11705::$$$message_0093_0012_0001$$$::Not just the passport, but there's also a visa inspection, so I wouldn't recommend a travel companion like Kiritsugu.[lr]::
11706::$$$message_0093_0012_0002$$$::Fuji-nee is also a woman.::
11707::$$$message_0093_0013_0000$$$::"I would chase Kiritsugu until here whenever he went overseas, but I couldn't ask him to take me with him."[lr]::
11708::$$$message_0093_0013_0001$$$::"...I see."::
11709::$$$message_0093_0014_0000$$$::"Kiritsugu would tell me, 'Take care of Shirou.' So I would just say that I understood.[lr]::
11710::$$$message_0093_0014_0001$$$::I should've forced myself to chase after him and see what he was doing overseas at least once."::
11711::$$$message_0093_0015_0000$$$::She laughs helplessly.[lr]::
11712::$$$message_0093_0015_0001$$$::It's not like I saw what Kiritsugu was doing on the other side of the ocean with my own eyes.[lr]::
11713::$$$message_0093_0015_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤01a(中) textoff=0]But, I would simply be waiting with Fuji-nee and looking forward to Kiritsugu coming home and talking about absurd stories, without knowing when that would be.::
11714::$$$message_0093_0016_0000$$$::"I should've gone too."[lr]::
11715::$$$message_0093_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah, I don't think he would've gotten punished even if he took us at least once."[lr]::
11716::$$$message_0093_0016_0002$$$::"But, we have no idea where or what the old man was doing.[lr]::
11717::$$$message_0093_0016_0003$$$::It's fine if it was like Europe or something, but what if he saw some mysterious ancient race that claimed to be the descendants of aliens in the hinterland of Africa?"::
11718::$$$message_0093_0017_0000$$$::...I don't think it's that crazy, but something similar is possible.[lr]::
11719::$$$message_0093_0017_0001$$$::Kiritsugu went to the Andes or the Amazon rainforest.[lr]::
11720::$$$message_0093_0017_0002$$$::I was troubled when he brought back some mask, where some bizarre spirit might come out, as a souvenir.::
11721::$$$message_0093_0018_0000$$$::"Africa? Hey, do you think there were tigers?"[lr]::
11722::$$$message_0093_0018_0001$$$::"I don't think so. Even if there were, he said they don't jump out conveniently in front of the camera."::
11723::$$$message_0093_0019_0000$$$::"It's okay, even the tiger would retreat after one attack since I'm here... [cacheimage storage=藤08e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08e(中) textoff=0]right? ...I'm Sandan in kendo, but I'll finally be equal with a carnivorous animal once I have a hunting rifle... [cacheimage storage=藤08f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=藤08f(中) textoff=0]Hmm..."::
11724::$$$message_0093_0020_0000$$$::Are you Kiyomasa Kato...? Being more than on par when fighting a tiger is like Saber and the others' world.[lr]::
11725::$$$message_0093_0020_0001$$$::Fuji-nee starts to visualize fighting a tiger. In her imagination, it seems like she has enough chance at winning.::
11726::$$$message_0093_0021_0000$$$::"...This is hard, if I at least had an old first-rate sword, then I could barely..."[lr]::
11727::$$$message_0093_0021_0001$$$::"Oh, don't take out the old man's collection for something like that. First of all, Kiritsugu is..."::
11728::$$$message_0093_0022_0000$$$::...a mage, and Fuji-nee is a warrior.[lr]::
11729::$$$message_0093_0022_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=藤01a(中) textoff=0]...I might be thinking about my old man because of the atmosphere of this wharf.[lr]::
11730::$$$message_0093_0022_0002$$$::Fuji-nee must also be taking in the nostalgia...::
11731::$$$message_0093_0023_0000$$$::"...But, Kiritsugu is also... [cacheimage storage=藤10b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=藤10b(中) time=300 textoff=0]Ahh, let's stop."[lr]::
11732::$$$message_0093_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah.[lr]::
11733::$$$message_0093_0023_0002$$$::Hey, Fuji-nee. Should I take you to the other side of the ocean on behalf of Kiritsugu sometime?"[lr]::
11734::$$$message_0093_0023_0003$$$::Oops.[lr]::
11735::$$$message_0093_0023_0004$$$::Did I say something dumb?::
11736::$$$message_0093_0024_0000$$$::"It's the other way around. I'm going to take you abroad. There's your graduation trip, right?"[lr]::
11737::$$$message_0093_0024_0001$$$::"Guh, I don't wanna go on a graduation trip with a teacher accompanying me..."[lr]::
11738::$$$message_0093_0024_0002$$$::"Look at you getting embarrassed, you little!"[lr]::
11739::$$$message_0093_0024_0003$$$::"D-Don't be stupid, I'm not embarrassed, I'm saying that's pathetic!"::
911698::$$$message_9093_0009_0001$$$::Fuji-nee murmurs nostalgically, looking into the horizon of the port.[r]::
�